SC:R Enhanced, a patch of the SC:R mod, reads the game data of a user-owned StarCraft: Remastered installation; its mod jar carries no such data.

Third-party material
====================

The mod jar carries LICENSE and NOTICE in META-INF/.

Fonts
-----

SC:R Enhanced ships no third-party font: it uses the fonts of the user's own installation.

